### 📋 Overview of Changes

1. **`ApprovalModeChanged` Core Event Definition**:
   * Defined the new `CoreEvent.ApprovalModeChanged` in [events.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_23230/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/utils/events.ts).
   * Declared the typed `ApprovalModeChangedPayload` carry-over payload (with `approvalMode` and `sessionId`).
   * Added the `emitApprovalModeChanged` helper emitter on the `CoreEventEmitter` class.

2. **Firing the Event**:
   * Updated `setApprovalMode` in [config.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_23230/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/config/config.ts) to emit `CoreEvent.ApprovalModeChanged` whenever a transition between different approval modes occurs.

3. **Resetting the Sticky Model**:
   * Updated [client.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_23230/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/core/client.ts) constructor to observe `CoreEvent.ApprovalModeChanged`.
   * Added `handleApprovalModeChanged` to correctly reset `this.currentSequenceModel = null` when receiving an event for the active session, thereby forcing a safe re-evaluation of the correct model on the next turn.
   * Cleared the listener subscription correctly in `dispose()`.

4. **Comprehensive Test Suite additions**:
   * Added unit tests to [client.test.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_23230/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/core/client.test.ts) to explicitly verify that a change in approval mode correctly resets the `currentSequenceModel` of `GeminiClient` in a session-aware manner.

